    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700920/extras/3c228fb5604318e6dfd28d7633d52547.poster.avif?t=1749418511\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700920/extras/3c228fb5604318e6dfd28d7633d52547.webm?t=1749418511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700920/extras/3c228fb5604318e6dfd28d7633d52547.mp4?t=1749418511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a race to the finish line! Switch between balls to overcome obstacles and bump your competition out of the way in this chaotic online multiplayer experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realtime cross-platform online multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic physics-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural  race track construction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 obstacle types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 ball types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 unlockable trails</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700920/extras/3c228fb5604318e6dfd28d7633d52547.poster.avif?t=1749418511\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700920/extras/3c228fb5604318e6dfd28d7633d52547.webm?t=1749418511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700920/extras/3c228fb5604318e6dfd28d7633d52547.mp4?t=1749418511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a race to the finish line! Switch between balls to overcome obstacles and bump your competition out of the way in this chaotic online multiplayer experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realtime cross-platform online multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic physics-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural  race track construction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 obstacle types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 ball types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 unlockable trails</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "It's a race to the finish line! Switch between balls to overcome obstacles and bump your competition out of the way in this chaotic online multiplayer experience!",
